    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Whirligig</strong> is the ultimate media player for both VR and traditional desktop users who want to experience fully immersive media in the best possible way. It offers a wide range of options for watching 2D, 3D, and 360\u00b0 content. Whether you're using a VR headset or a standard monitor/projector, Whirligig delivers a customizable viewing experience to help you get the most out of your immersive media.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf10 <strong>VR + Non-VR Playback</strong><br>Fully functional as both a VR player (compatible with OpenXR/SteamVR headsets) and a desktop media player \u2014 perfect for watching 360\u00b0 immersive and stereoscopic media.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa5 <strong>Comprehensive 3D Support</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Side-by-Side (SBS) and Over/Under (OU) support, with desktop viewing options for anaglyph (red/green glasses) and 3D projectors/TVs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adjustable 3D depth and convergence for perfect stereoscopic viewing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support for 180\u00b0 and 360\u00b0 3D videos in both desktop and VR modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f <strong>Advanced Playback Options</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple projection modes: Cinema, Fisheye, Equirectangular/Barrel, and a selection of custom formats, including support for less common types like cubemaps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience your media is a variety of 3D environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Passthrough for compatible headsets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd27 <strong>Customization &amp; Control</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three decoding methods (DirectShow, Media Foundation, libVLC) for maximum compatibility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Save/load presets for different media types and viewing environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full 5.1 surround sound support with positional audio in VR (when using Media Foundation).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Subtitle support.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Why Choose Whirligig?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The most versatile 3D media player on Steam, with support for both VR and flat-screen viewing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Regular updates with new features and improvements.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Whirligig</strong> is the ultimate media player for both VR and traditional desktop users who want to experience fully immersive media in the best possible way. It offers a wide range of options for watching 2D, 3D, and 360\u00b0 content. Whether you're using a VR headset or a standard monitor/projector, Whirligig delivers a customizable viewing experience to help you get the most out of your immersive media.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf10 <strong>VR + Non-VR Playback</strong><br>Fully functional as both a VR player (compatible with OpenXR/SteamVR headsets) and a desktop media player \u2014 perfect for watching 360\u00b0 immersive and stereoscopic media.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa5 <strong>Comprehensive 3D Support</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Side-by-Side (SBS) and Over/Under (OU) support, with desktop viewing options for anaglyph (red/green glasses) and 3D projectors/TVs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adjustable 3D depth and convergence for perfect stereoscopic viewing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support for 180\u00b0 and 360\u00b0 3D videos in both desktop and VR modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f <strong>Advanced Playback Options</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple projection modes: Cinema, Fisheye, Equirectangular/Barrel, and a selection of custom formats, including support for less common types like cubemaps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience your media is a variety of 3D environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Passthrough for compatible headsets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd27 <strong>Customization &amp; Control</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three decoding methods (DirectShow, Media Foundation, libVLC) for maximum compatibility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Save/load presets for different media types and viewing environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full 5.1 surround sound support with positional audio in VR (when using Media Foundation).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Subtitle support.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Why Choose Whirligig?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The most versatile 3D media player on Steam, with support for both VR and flat-screen viewing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Regular updates with new features and improvements.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A versatile VR and desktop media player for watching 2D, 3D, and 360\u00b0 videos with customizable playback, projection modes, and full stereoscopic support.",
